1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,800
What if your savings could stay on Mezo, while you used a claim on them on another blockchain?

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:11,900
Today, moving savings value elsewhere means withdrawing first, forfeiting your position, and bridging raw stablecoins.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:17,500
MUSD Reach changes that. Your savings position stays right on Mezo.

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:23,900
We wrap and lock the corresponding savings shares, then issue a backed, transferable receipt on Base Sepolia.

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:30,000
Here is the live application. I connect my wallet on Mezo testnet, enter six MUSD, and initiate the lock.

6
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:38,500
In a single atomic transaction, the MUSD enters the native savings vault, shares are wrapped, and locked in the source gateway.

7
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:45,300
Here is the confirmed transaction on Mezo testnet at block 16279430.

8
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,500
Wormhole carries the authenticated message to Base Sepolia. Once Wormhole guardians sign the proof,

9
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:58,000
the destination gateway verifies every parameter, consumes the transfer ID, and mints exactly six rwSMUSD receipts.

10
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:03,000
The underlying savings shares remain locked and safe on Mezo.

11
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:09,000
That receipt is a standard ERC-20. It can be held, traded, or transferred to another wallet—

12
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:13,800
which we verified on BaseScan with a three rwSMUSD transfer.

13
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:18,500
And when the holder wants their value back, they burn the receipt on Base.

14
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:23,700
The authenticated return message releases the corresponding shares or unwrapped MUSD directly on Mezo.

15
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:29,500
This is not just bridging tokens. It is making savings positions portable while keeping liquidity on Mezo.

16
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:35,000
And you do not have to take our word for it: our public proof engine reconciles every locked share

17
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:40,200
against issued receipts in real time, with sixty-two independent verification checks passing.

18
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:46,500
MUSD Reach allows Mezo to keep its core savings liquidity, while empowering savers to explore the broader crypto economy.

19
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:51,500
Fully functional, verified on public testnets, with transparent backing.

20
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:56,500
Your savings stay on Mezo. Their reach doesn't have to.
